7
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,348
A fixed-refresh screen scans

8
00:00:10,348 --> 00:00:10,690
a new

9
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:11,287
image on

10
00:00:11,287 --> 00:00:11,799
its own

11
00:00:11,799 --> 00:00:12,226
