15
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:17,560
The GPU finishes

16
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:18,460
frames on

17
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:19,220
a different schedule,

18
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:20,200
